	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Obsignatis litteris rediit noster nobilis pręfectus, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>legum doctor pietatisque amans, ex <placeName ref="l157">Francofurto Moeni</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>defunctus legatione principis hęcque nova retulit etc.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Ministri ecclesię <placeName ref="l157">Francofurdiensis</placeName> disputationem satis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>gravem habuerunt de libero arbitrio et de predestinatione, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sed non potuisse convenire.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Mihi fit verisimile <lb xml:id="p1z7"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallicanam</placeName> illic ecclesiam cum <placeName ref="l822">Germana</placeName> contendisse.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Marchio <persName ref="p8371">Albertus</persName> lęthaliter decumbit Heidelbergę.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName ref="p18137">Doctor Marckbachius</persName> <placeName ref="l491">Argentinens[is]</placeName> visitat ecclesias <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName>Palatinus</persName> omnesque, ut vocant, <persName>Zvinglianos</persName> hęreticos a<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>mandat, homo imperiosus, et nobis minitatur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Sed illius minas atque concordiam iuxta facimus etc.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Est quidam cancellarius <persName>marchionis Alberthi</persName>, <persName>Petrus <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Osiander</persName>, qui scribit contra <persName>Sleidanum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quidam episcopi <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l307">Moguntię</placeName> conventum habuerunt; quid actum, ignoratur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentoratenses</placeName> conantur pfaffones suos ablegare; nam <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>anni, quibus cum episcopo pacti sunt, iam finiuntur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quod <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>si factum fuerit, dicemus camelum saltasse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><persName ref="p8364">Beatus Gerungus</persName>, <persName>Thomę</persName> contionator, me heri convenit; <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>parentem secum abducit <placeName ref="l491">Argentoratum</placeName>, qui hactenus vixit ex men<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>dicitate; sepius illum monui etc.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Illi non convenit cum omnibus <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ministris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sic abundat quisque suo sensu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/><persName ref="p1010">Erbius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
